     A*
     A* Upload Bill Transmission Information
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Created on 01/17/2003 by c:62 for Project 126MBD
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Purpose: This file will hold the member #, date/time uploaded,
     A*          date/time converted, and date/time processed of the
     A*          "batch" of bills received from Provima.
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Revisions:
     A*
     A* 09/30/03 c:62 Project 126MBR
     A*               Add count fields
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PU901                     TEXT('Upload Bill Trans Info')
     A            U9NAME    R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A                                      COLHDG('FPRVP member #')
     A            U9MBR#    R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A                                      COLHDG('FAU0P member #')
     A            U9ULDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Upload Date')
     A*           Upload date when FAU9P record created, FAU9P Member
     A*           name assigned
     A*
     A            U9ULTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Upload Time')
     A            U9CVDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Convert Date')
     A*           Convert date when data converted from FAU0P file to
     A*           FAU1P and FAU2P
     A*
     A            U9CVTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Convert Time')
     A            U9PRDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Process Date')
     A*           Process date when all FAU1P records have a value
     A*           in U1PRFL for a given "batch".  This will prevent
     A*           the document in Provima from appearing on the "Upload
     A*           Provima Bills" screen, since all the FAU1P records
     A*           have been processed.  We don't want to process that
     A*           member again.
     A*
     A            U9PRTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Process Time')
     A*
     A            U9STAT    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Status')
     A            U9USER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint User')
     A            U9PGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Program')
     A            U9TIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Time')
     A            U9DT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Date')
     A            U9IUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial User')
     A            U9IPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Program')
     A            U9ITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Time')
     A            U9IDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Date')
     A*** BEGIN ADD *** 09/30/03 **************************************
     A            U9TCNT    R               REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('Total Count')
     A            U9DCNT    R               REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('Duplicate Count')
     A            U9CCNT    R               REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('Claim Error Count')
     A            U9RCNT    R               REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('Recon Error Count')
     A            U9UCNT    R               REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('Uploaded Count')
     A*** END   ADD *** 09/30/03 **************************************
